{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）和李炘頤（Alina）前天（25日）在峇里舉行浪漫婚禮，MIRROR隊友姜濤﹑呂爵安（Edan）﹑柳應廷﹑李駿傑﹑盧瀚霆和邱傲然出席婚禮，一對新人為賓客送上親筆寫的感謝卡。</p><p>婚禮過後，大伙兒已先後返港。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:58:14.969164+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T05:11:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T00:18:10.063253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:58:14.969164+00:00","content_hash":"5f196bc998e866d1783057a0fe8d7305925239899ec2e518209ddded80eb1468","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}